	[m2]а) быть наравне с кем-л., [p]чем-л.[/p] Jim was abreast of the leading runner for a few minutes but then fell behind. б) быть в курсе дела Scientists have to be abreast of the latest discoveries and developments if they want to advance in their profession.

be accorded permission
