	[m2]а) получать [p]что-л.[/p] What answer can you draw from the proofs that are offered? The moral to be drawn from this story is that honesty is best. His income is drawn from several different businesses. б) списывать, копировать All the characters in the story are drawn from life. The writer drew the stories from her own experience. в) собирать, отбирать Members of Parliament are drawn from all classes of society. The children chosen to perform in the city concert have been drawn from schools all over the city. Farmers have to draw seasonal helpers from the unemployed.

draw in
	[m2]а) вовлекать б) сокращать (расходы и [p]т. п.[/p]) в) близиться к концу (о дне); сокращаться (о днях) The days are drawing in now that it is autumn. г) to draw in on a cigarette затянуться папиросой д) медленно подъезжать к остановке The train drew in (to the station) and all the passengers got off. е) привлекать (людей) The play drew in large crowds ж) убедить [p]кого-л.[/p] присоединиться It's your private quarrel, don't try to draw me in. Gradually the other performers were drawn in.

draw into
	[m2]а) медленно подъезжать к остановке The train is just drawing into the station. if we hurry we can catch it б) вовлекать [p]кого-л.[/p] во [p]что-л.[/p] My brother was drawn into a fight outside the hotel. Many other areas are being drawn into the government's plans for rehousing the population.

