grind down
	[m2]а) размалывать(ся) Mills used to use heavy stones to grind down the wheat into flour, now they use more modern machinery. б) стачивать A new knife needs to be ground down to get it really sharp. в) замучить The villagers of the Middle Ages were often ground down by their lords and masters. Don't let the army grind you down!

grind in
	[m2]а) пришлифовывать, притирать б) вдалбливать Your only hope of passing the examination is to have these facts ground in by endless repetition.

grind out
	[m2]а) вымучивать из себя, выполнять с большим трудом Dying of thirst, the desert traveller ground out a request for water. б) [p]тех.[/p] вытачивать This machine grinds out the crushed rock ready for road building. в) придавить, растоптать (окурок и [p]т. п.[/p]) г) пиликать When will the pianist stop grinding out the same old tunes?

