rub off
	[m2]а) стирать(ся); выводить (пятно) If you don't prepare the surface properly, the paint will rub off. These new boots are so stiff that they rub the skin off my ankles. б) отразиться, сказаться; (on, onto — на [p]чем-л.[/p]) I hope that some fine qualities of Mary's character will rub off onto you.

rub out
	[m2]а) стирать, вычищать Will this rubber rub out ink marks? б) [p]ам.[/p] [p]разг.[/p] убивать Anyone who opposes our organization will get rubbed out.

